VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT memo-bridge.delivery

GOAL
  A memo-bridge change is done only when this exact commit proves the whole
  suite and every collision invariant, each invariant guarded by a killed mutant.

CLAIM suite REQUIRED
  ENSURE the whole pnpm test suite passes on this commit
INVARIANT claim-exclusive CRITICAL
  ENSURE one Issue has exactly one live claim holder
INVARIANT fence-monotonic CRITICAL
  ENSURE a stale fence never writes
INVARIANT clock-skew CRITICAL
  ENSURE two skewed clocks never make two holders
INVARIANT worktree-exclusive CRITICAL
  ENSURE one branch and one path have exactly one worktree
INVARIANT lock-exclusive CRITICAL
  ENSURE one operator lock has one holder, even after a hub restart
INVARIANT mutants-killed CRITICAL
  ENSURE every mutant makes its invariant test fail

VERIFY suite
  USING suite.pnpm
VERIFY claim-exclusive
  USING invariant.claim-exclusive
VERIFY fence-monotonic
  USING invariant.fence-monotonic
VERIFY clock-skew
  USING invariant.clock-skew
VERIFY worktree-exclusive
  USING invariant.worktree-exclusive
VERIFY lock-exclusive
  USING invariant.lock-exclusive
VERIFY mutants-killed
  USING invariant.mutants-killed

ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
